# Roost local config — copy to ".env" (gitignored) only if you want to override defaults.
# You usually don't need this file.
#
# Roost ships NO webhook secret. By default, Contact-form feedback is relayed to the project's
# hosted endpoint. To send feedback to YOUR OWN Slack/Discord directly instead, set:
#   CONTACT_WEBHOOK_BUG=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...      # bug reports
#   CONTACT_WEBHOOK_FEATURE=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...  # feature requests
#   CONTACT_WEBHOOK=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...          # single fallback for both
# Or relay to a different endpoint of your own:
#   FEEDBACK_RELAY=https://your-host.example.com/api/contact
